cargo-zempic 0.0.1
    workspace: [WORKSPACE_ROOT]  (1 members, 1 selected)
      profile: release  (inherits: none)
optimizing for: size
       target: aarch64-apple-darwin

TIER 1  FOUNDATIONAL                                                   1 finding

  HIGH   moderate profile/debug-info               true -> false
        effort: trivial   runtime cost: none   fix: safe
        Debug information is produced and then dropped by stripping. Disabling
        `debug` saves compile time and the intermediate disk it writes while
        leaving the linked artifact largely unchanged.
        Tradeoff: A binary built without debug information cannot be stepped through.

SUMMARY
  1 finding: 1 high.  By magnitude: 1 moderate.
  1 auto-fixable.

  Magnitude is an ordinal judgement, not a measurement. zempic does not build
  and does not read compiled artifacts, so it reports no sizes.
